    <string name="onboarding_title_what">Your Mac, in your pocket.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_body_what">Peering shows your Mac\'s screen on this phone and lets you work on it from here. The two devices pair once, and no account is involved.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_title_install">Install the host on your Mac</string>
    <string name="onboarding_body_install">Get the Peering host app for macOS and open it. Allow Screen Recording and Accessibility when it asks. Keep the Mac awake and on a network this phone can reach.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_title_scan">Scan the pairing code</string>
    <string name="onboarding_body_scan">The Mac shows a code in its Devices list. Scan it here, then check that the six digits match on both screens before you continue.</string>
